BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Art & Garden Festival
DTSTART:20260712T000000
DTEND:20260712T000000
UID:25a5daee3fd6696c63c75620e45a8f80@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 2026 Art & Garden Festival \, one of Petaluma
 ’s most cherished summer traditions! The 23rd Art & Garden Festival is a
  vibrant\, family-friendly celebration of creativity\, community\, and loc
 al flavor. Each year\, over 15\,000 people fill the historic downtown to e
 njoy a lively day of art\, music\, food\, and fun. While you’re explorin
 g the festival\, stop by Adobe Road Winery’s tasting room just steps awa
 y from the action. Cool off with a glass of our award-winning wine\, or en
 joy a curated wine tasting as you enjoy one of Petaluma’s most festive S
 undays. Our tasting room is open 11:00 AM to 7:00 PM. We hope to see you a
 t the Downtown Petaluma Art & Garden Festival!
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/petaluma-art-and-garden-festival-202
 6/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Summer Sidewalk Sale
DTSTART:20260730T000000
DTEND:20260802T000000
UID:80362e2222992aa00be3ae12b94d7404@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 2026 Downtown Petaluma Summer Sidewalk Sale \,
  one of Petaluma’s best times to visit! The annual Downtown Sidewalk Sal
 e will take place Thursday\, July 30 through Sunday\, August 2\, 2026. Ind
 ependent stores and restaurants are a vital part of the special character 
 of Downtown Petaluma. The Sidewalk Sale is a perfect opportunity to do you
 r part in keeping Petaluma retail alive and take home some great items at 
 a fraction of the cost. While you’re exploring the shops\, stop by Adobe
  Road Winery’s tasting room in the heart of downtown. Cool off with a gl
 ass of our award-winning wine\, or enjoy a curated wine tasting as you enj
 oy one of Petaluma’s best shopping weekends. Our tasting room is open 11
 :00 AM to 7:00 PM. We hope to see you at the Downtown Petaluma Summer Side
 walk Sale!
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/downtown-petaluma-summer-sidewalk-sa
 le/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
